Someone asked what would the amulet of reincarnation add to the game of 
Nethack. I forget who posted that since it simply does what the amulet of 
life saving already does.

The amulet of reincarnation, as suggested, is not something you can keep a 
bunch around because in the end you can only use one or two of these unlike 
the unlimited amount of amulets of life saving one can use in the game. 
Plus there's the amnesia element.

It may make the quests harder and provide a challenge to the player. 
There's the issue of artifacts blasting the user but that would provide a 
challenge to the game.

Why have tins of spinach when it's perfectly feasible to use a potion of 
gain ability? Wear a ring of strength or increase damage or wear gauntlets 
of power to increase one's strength or damage dealt during combat.

